@startuml
actor TeamLeader
actor Lecturer
boundary ProjectRegistrationInterface
control ProjectController
control ProjectManagementService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

TeamLeader -> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Access project proposal registration
ProjectRegistrationInterface -> ProjectController: Request project proposal form
ProjectController -> ProjectManagementService: Fetch proposal form
ProjectManagementService -> Database: Retrieve form template
Database --> ProjectManagementService: Return form template
ProjectManagementService --> ProjectController: Return form template
ProjectController --> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Display project proposal form
ProjectRegistrationInterface --> TeamLeader: Show project proposal form

TeamLeader -> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Enter project details and upload documents
ProjectRegistrationInterface -> ProjectController: Submit project proposal
ProjectController -> ProjectManagementService: Store project proposal
ProjectManagementService -> Database: Store project details and documents
Database --> ProjectManagementService: Confirm storage
ProjectManagementService --> ProjectController: Confirm successful registration
ProjectController --> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Confirm successful registration
ProjectRegistrationInterface --> TeamLeader: Display confirmation and next steps

ProjectManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify lecturer of new project proposal
NotificationService -> Lecturer: Send proposal notification

Lecturer -> ProjectController: Access project overview
ProjectController -> ProjectManagementService: Retrieve overall project details
ProjectManagementService -> Database: Fetch all project details
Database --> ProjectManagementService: Return project details
ProjectManagementService --> ProjectController: Return project details
ProjectController --> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Display project overview
ProjectRegistrationInterface --> Lecturer: Show project overview

Lecturer -> ProjectManagementService: Review project proposal
Lecturer -> ProjectManagementService: Approve/Reject project proposal
ProjectManagementService -> Database: Update project status
Database --> ProjectManagementService: Confirm status update
ProjectManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify team leader of approval/rejection
NotificationService -> TeamLeader: Send approval/rejection notification
ProjectManagementService -> ProjectController: Confirm project status update
ProjectController -> ProjectRegistrationInterface: Display project status
ProjectRegistrationInterface --> TeamLeader: Show project status

@enduml